        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Maurice Newman\n- Organizations: Australian Broadcasting Corporation, Australian Stock Exchange, Prime Minister's Business Advisory Council\n- Universities: Macquarie University\n- Places: Ilford, England, Sydney, Australia, Macquarie Park\n- Roles: Chairperson, board chair, Chancellor, council member\n\nFacts:\n- Maurice Lionel Newman was born on 20 April 1938 in Ilford, England.\n- Maurice Newman is an Australian businessman.\n- Maurice Newman served as Chairperson of the Australian Broadcasting Corporation.\n- Maurice Newman served as chair of the board of the Australian Stock Exchange.\n- Maurice Newman served as Chancellor of Macquarie University.\n- Maurice Newman was a member of the Prime Minister's Business Advisory Council from September 2013 to September 2015.\n- Macquarie University is a public research university based in Sydney, Australia, in the suburb of Macquarie Park.",
